From 2746c3833b7d5b01593620b2dee376ba9027a8d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yofuness <compiledchickennuggets@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:15:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sunfish: Bluetooth kernel transport, com.apple.uart.bluetooth
 + /dev/btbridge (0226)

New bsd/dev/sweet_btbridge.c (boot-arg btbridge=1; btbridge=3 nodes only; default off):
the kernel control com.apple.uart.bluetooth and /dev/cu.bluetooth, /dev/uart.bluetooth
(one H4 pipe for bluetoothd) <-> /dev/btbridge (phone/wifi/btbridge), dummy /dev/btwake.
16.7 bluetoothd has no plain-tty H4 driver (bt4); it needs
BT_HCI_TRANSPORT=H4BC:POSIX:com.apple.uart.bluetooth,115200.

Adapted from DenialOfGravity/ios-redfin xnu 1010 + 1015 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026
dipa-studio; see CREDITS.md): termios default 115200, userland side is our btbridge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bsd/conf/files           |   1 +
 bsd/dev/sweet_btbridge.c | 546 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bsd/dev/sweet_ufs.c      |   2 +
 3 files changed, 549 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 bsd/dev/sweet_btbridge.c

